        text: "One leg left, and it takes you back to where the walk started. Return to the fountain and follow 51st Street east, past Ellis and Woodlawn, under the railroad embankment, to Lake Park Avenue. Turn south there and stay on Lake Park to 53rd Street. The plaza on the corner, shops on the ground floor under a glass office tower, is Harper Court. The number 4 bus down Cottage Grove and the Metra at 51st and Lake Park both cut the distance if your feet are done.",
